{"id":"5ce5e89e178fbbbe","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-interpolation-craig.md","title":"Craig Interpolation Theorem","display":"Craig Interpolation Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-interpolation-craig","aliases":["93-thm-interpolation-craig"],"display":"Craig Interpolation Theorem","depends_on":["[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]","[[93-df-craig-interpolation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-interpolation-craig"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-interpolation-craig</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Craig Interpolation Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eda3df85f724c1ae\" href=\"?note=eda3df85f724c1ae\" title=\"93-df-craig-interpolation\">93-df-craig-interpolation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-interpolation-craig-—-Craig-Interpolation-Theorem\">thm-interpolation-craig — Craig Interpolation Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> is the concrete classical Hilbert presentation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3c8f5c9e577b791\" href=\"?note=e3c8f5c9e577b791\" title=\"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus\">93-df-classical-propositional-calculus</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\">\\(\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\)</span> is the type-indexed interpolation property of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eda3df85f724c1ae\" href=\"?note=eda3df85f724c1ae\" title=\"93-df-craig-interpolation\">93-df-craig-interpolation</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}craig}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}craig}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Expanding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}\\)</span> yields the derivability and shared-variable clauses. The antecedent is a formal presentation predicate, rather than the prose-only phrase “is classical propositional logic.”</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-interpolation-craig-—-Craig-Interpolation-Theorem","text":"thm-interpolation-craig — Craig Interpolation Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-craig-interpolation","status":"resolved","id":"eda3df85f724c1ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-craig-interpolation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-classical-propositional-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)$ is the concrete classical Hilbert presentation of [[93-df-classical-propositional-calculus]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-craig-interpolation","status":"resolved","id":"eda3df85f724c1ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})$ is the type-indexed interpolation property of [[93-df-craig-interpolation]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}interpolation\\text{-}craig}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPLPres}_{93}(\\mathcal P,\\mathsf L,\\mathcal L)\\to\n\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}","display":false}],"bytes":1057,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["e3c8f5c9e577b791","eda3df85f724c1ae"]}